-- src:213 | (7) If in an enactment power is given to a person to inspect or to require the production of records, the power includes the power to make copies or extracts of the records.
@ref Interpretation Act (BC) s 27(7) (src:213)
GIVEN thing IS A `Something a power to inspect or require the production of records includes`
      `an enactment gives the person power to inspect or to require the production of records` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 27(7) the power to inspect or require the production of records includes the power` thing `an enactment gives the person power to inspect or to require the production of records` MEANS
    IF   `an enactment gives the person power to inspect or to require the production of records`
